messages.content:
Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: contrib/visupng/VisualPng.c
Line: 189
Function: WndProc
Bug type: out-of-bounds-read
CWE: CWE-125
Explanation: strcpy reads from szCmdFileName, which may not be NUL-terminated due to the earlier strncpy at line 109 (when the command line is quoted and the copied substring length equals the count). This causes strcpy to read past the end of szCmdFileName and can also lead to overflow of szImgPathName.

